## Stamp
Slot meanings: LAUNCH AUTHORITY = who launched and READY 90 / HARD STOP 180 minutes after your Step-0, absolute clocks written by you. RULING-REF = a product-owner ruling, if any, that the stamp relays for the two landings or the MPSCALC-118 judgement (default: none known; C-96 then says "no product-owner ruling is known to rest on it"; nothing is invented). CARD-REF = the exact id for the `--delivered` line only (never in a record). COMMENTS (MPSCALC-107 and -116): FILE or HOLD (default HOLD; recommended FILE). MOVE-KEYS: a comma list among MPSCALC-107, MPSCALC-116, or NONE (default NONE; recommended both if the tables read MET). ROW-RESIDUAL: YES or NO (reading (k), `CLARIFICATIONS.md:1957`: Minors held only as backlog rows do not hold MPSCALC-107; default NO; it reaches MPSCALC-107 only). MINORS-AS: ROWS or TICKET (default ROWS). COMMENT-118: FILE or HOLD (default HOLD; recommended FILE). COMMENT-374-375: FILE-GAPS or HOLD (default HOLD; recommended FILE-GAPS). REC-CLAR-96: FILE or HOLD (default HOLD; recommended FILE).
